<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4992"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Bridgieb<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Bridgieb<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 9:10 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I&#39;m with you stealth!And I think Kevin&#39;s story was fishy from the get go. <BR>I know this has been done,but,I still believe that there is a possible drug connection here.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
