<!--Post: 5066--><!--Time: 1106860027-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5066"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 1:07 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Stealth, your making statements of fact when they are your opinions at best. Unless your claiming to be or know BTK then how would you be able to do as such? <BR> <BR>Also: You wrote: &#34; Julie Otero and Kathryn worked side by side&#34; <BR> <BR>I believe i read that they did, in fact, NOT work on the same line at the same time. I could be wrong but I believe this to be the case.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
