<!--Post: 5131--><!--Time: 1106891150-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5131"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Thursday, January 27, 2005 - 9:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Q you would be wrong on the working side by side...it is late where I am but I will put it up for you tomorrow &#40;I have several files where a pull all FACTS and references and keep them to support my conclusions&#41;...perhaps you should take your own advice and make sure you have your facts straight before making accusations...please adjust your attitude when you make comments like that directly to me...I give you respect and expect the same...My last post has some conclusions based on reading everything Charlie has said about his mother on all the boards, knowing for a fact they worked side by side, and my real world experience managing factories where ladies have to do boring work...Please tell me what is not a fact or logical conclusion; where have I presented opinion as fact? What do you dispute? &#40; &amp; I owe you the work link&#41;<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5131-->
<!--Post: 5138--><!--Time: 1106917091-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5138"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 4:58 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Although Kathryn Bright and Julie Otero worked on the same assembly line at Coleman, police did not make a public connection between the cases.&#34; <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.charlotte.com/mld/kansas/news/special_packages/btk/8348962.htm?1c" target=_top>http://www.charlotte.com/mld/kansas/news/special_p ackages/btk/8348962.htm?1c</a> <BR> <BR>The post you refer to was correct.  Looking back, the one previous to that, I probably should have added I believe. But that leads me to another question, when did Tom hire you to run the site?  <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5138-->
<!--Post: 5200--><!--Time: 1106949010-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5200"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 1:50 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I don&#39;t see where your anger is justified stealth.  <BR> <BR>I&#39;m not running anything just asking you to seperate opinion and fact. <BR> <BR> <BR>Quote: <BR>__________________________________________________ <BR>&#34;Please tell me what is not a fact or logical conclusion; where have I presented opinion as fact?&#34; <BR>__________________________________________________ <BR> <BR>For example: <BR> <BR>You state opinion as fact: &#34;Kathryn knew who BTK was...BTK learned about the Otero&#39;s from Kathryn &amp; Kevin&#34; <BR> <BR>As I said you don&#39;t know this as fact unless you are BTK... I&#39;m not accusing you just pointing it out. <BR> <BR>Also your link is to a &#34;sign up&#34; page. <BR> <BR> <BR>BTW: I still think it is stated somewhere that Kathryn Bright and Julie Otero didn&#39;t work on the same line at &#34;the same time&#40;s&#41;.&#34; <BR> <BR>Note the &#34;same time&#40;s&#41;.&#34; <BR> <BR> <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5200-->
<!--Post: 5211--><!--Time: 1106951721-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5211"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Jrl<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Jrl<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 2:35 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Q, <BR> <BR>I have to agree with you.  I read that somewhere as well.  That Kathryn and Julie did not work at the same time or not on the same line...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5211-->
<!--Post: 5223--><!--Time: 1106954003-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5223"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 3:13 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Julie Otero and Kathryn Bright did work on the same line but not at the same time. <BR> Until early January of 1974 when she was laid off Otero was working on an assembly line. Bright was working in another area of the plant and in March of 1974 was assigned to the assembly line that Otero had worked at. <BR>Apparently at some point into the BTK investigation police on several occassions took Kevin Bright to the Coleman plant to sit in a parked vehicle in the parking lot and observe Coleman workers going in and out of work to see if he might recognize his attacker as a Coleman employee.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5223-->
<!--Post: 5225--><!--Time: 1106955755-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5225"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 3:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->She always worked in the same department, along with Ms. Otero.  Kathryn had 2 different job responsibilities during her tenure at Coleman, but always in the same department. Have you ever spent a significant amount of time in a large manufacturing plant observing people?  I got paid to run one and did it well enough to get promoted the hell out of there.  I unedrstand what it means and I understand the inter-personal dynamics. <BR> <BR>The papers are owned by the same company so your Eagle login works at that site.  Technology.  I guess I should not have expected too much. Here you go, I&#39;ll continue to do your work for you: <BR> <BR><a href="http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_packages/btk/8348962.htm" target=_top>http://www.kansas.com/mld/kansas/news/special_pack ages/btk/8348962.htm</a> <BR> <BR>You came with no fact yourself to back your position.  So then you had to backtrack.  And before you posted your latest one I had already pointed that out myself. &#40;Learn some grace Q&#41; I have disagreed with a few things you have written and/or think they are silly.  So what.  I don&#39;t feel the need to interject in it.  If your going to call me out when I have supplied a verifiable reference, then you better prove it. Don&#39;t come back to me with &#34;I still think&#34;. <BR>   <BR>&#34;As I said you don&#39;t know this as fact unless you are BTK&#34; - I will use this as an example to point out you are limiting your viewpoints.  There are other possibilities, including one living witness.  But as I admitted before your response, I should have prefaced it with I believe. <BR> <BR>I respect the rights of others.  I am not here to please you.  I come here to discuss this case.  If you have a fact that renders something I say invalid, then please feel free to bring it up.  But if I supply facts, save me the I thinks disputing me.  Respect is a two way street.  Lots of people are going to be wrong about things before this is said and done.  Probably everyone since he&#39;s not in custody yet.  You feel me?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5225-->
<!--Post: 5226--><!--Time: 1106956011-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5226"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 3:46 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->&#34;Apparently at some point into the BTK investigation police on several occassions took Kevin Bright to the Coleman plant to sit in a parked vehicle in the parking lot and observe Coleman workers going in and out of work to see if he might recognize his attacker as a Coleman employee.&#34; <BR> <BR>This was in 1978...and what do you know, Kevin did not identify anyone...but it was too long after and not a very effective way to do it...Sounds like the Coleman people still weren&#39;t very cooperative...my position is he wouldn&#39;t have ID&#39;d BTK even if he saw him... <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5226-->
<!--Post: 5234--><!--Time: 1106960696-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5234"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 5:04 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I do wonder if there is a Coleman link to BTK besides the fact that Otero and Bright worked there. I&#39;m not thinking that he necessarily worked there but possibly had a relative he was close to or a friend who worked there or maybe hung out at a bar, diner or restaurant that was frequented by Coleman employees. <BR>Stealth or anyone, do you know of business near the Coleman plant that was frequented by Coleman employees on an everyday basis in 1974?  <BR>Also I heard that Police didn&#39;t believe there was a Coleman link until 1978. But I&#39;m kind of hazy on this. Since Otero had been a former Coleman employee and Bright a current on at the times of their deaths wouldn&#39;t police have investigated that possiblity in 1974 before they discounted it only to go back to it in 1978? Since Kathryn Bright was working at Coleman wouldn&#39;t the police have taken Kevin to Coleman in 1974 after his wounds healed and not in 1978?  <BR>Kevin Bright moved out of Wichita so was he even living there by 1978?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5234-->
<!--Post: 5236--><!--Time: 1106961655-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5236"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Iceteajan<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Iceteajan<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 5:20 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Forgive me if this was discussed before. <BR> <BR>Did Kevin Bright ever match BTKs famous voice message with the voice that he heard when he was being attacked? <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5236-->
<!--Post: 5243--><!--Time: 1106970034-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5243"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 7:40 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->There is an article about a Coleman link that ran on April 5th &#40;Bright attack April 4th&#41;......link below....then a stroy ran on April 8th where the Chief of Police denied there was a link???...I would like the backstory on who was applying the political pressure or making these dubious judgement calls...Less than 4 months after the Otero&#39;s no BTK link???...less than 4 days after the 3rd violent crime affecting 3 people in one department at Coleman &#40;not all of Coleman, just one little cluster in one department&#41;, there is no Coleman link???  You have to be kidding me.  I would say it was just for public consumption, but look at what happened, nothing!  People bought this?  No wonder this crime was not solved.  This is obstruction of justice through incomptence or by design.  <BR> <BR>- Johno - After the above, they didn&#39;t link it to BTK until his 1978 letter where he said there were 7.  They were trying to figure out who number 7 could be and what the motive was and arrived back at the Bright&#39;s.  I wondered about when Kevin Bright moved away. <BR> <BR>- Ice, that is a very good question. <BR> <BR><a href="http://members.fortunecity.com/ghostiesannex/newsarticles1.html" target=_top>http://members.fortunecity.com/ghostiesannex/newsa rticles1.html</a><!--/Text--></td></tr>
