<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5250"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Q<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Q<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 9:02 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Dude your a knee jerker of the utmost...Grace... please Mr. kettle <BR> <BR>I gave an example of you using opinion as fact and yet again you insult and jerk your knee so high it hits you in the head... Get over yourself man... I think your out of line and you &#34;were&#34; presenting opinion as fact... oh I&#39;m sorry... one living witness... now your Kevin Bright? <BR> <BR><!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5250-->
<!--Post: 5254--><!--Time: 1106981110-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5254"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Johno<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Johno<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->12-2004<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Friday, January 28, 2005 - 10:45 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->So in 1974 it&#39;s the Coleman connection with known BTK victim Julie Otero a former Coleman worker and Kathryn Bright a suspected BTK victim and a current Coleman worker and her brother Keven Bright a suspected BTK surviving victim and a former Coleman worker all meeting violence. Michael L. Williams a Coleman worker also meets violence when he is shot by unknown assailants 3 days before the Otero murders and then just 7 days before the bright murder his home is burglarized.  <BR> <BR>In 1977 it&#39;s a construction connection Shirley Vian a known BTK victim has a common-law huband who works in construction and known BTK victim Nancy Fox works for a construction company. I&#39;ve heard they both worked for the same comapany. I haven&#39;t seen that substantiated by more than one source but they did both work for construction companies. <BR> <BR>Fox also works part-time for a jewelry store and a few months befor her death a co-worker at that same jewelers Julie Ladd is found stabbed to death at the campus of WSU. Not believed to be BTK related but two female workers at the same jewlery store in a strip mall meet violent deaths just a few months apart. <BR>Then you have the WSU connection where BTK uses a xerox machine to make a copy of a poem about Nancy Fox to send to a TV station. In this same building is a class taught by PJ Wyatt who uses a textbook with a folk song in it from the 1920&#39;s that BTK plagerizes in another poem he writes. PJ also ends up as a title of BTK&#39;s autobiographical chapters. <BR> <BR>The construction theme re-enters the picture in 1986 when Vicki Wegerle becomes a BTK victim. Her husband does not work in construction as a field but comes pretty close in being a self-employed apartment maintence man. <BR>The construction theme predates 1977 with a BTK note found in a mechanical engineering book at the Wichita Public library in 1974. The library becomes a connection when a BTK package turns up at the public library 30 years later. <BR>Coleman-Construction-Jewlers-WSU-Wichita Public library. They all weave together in this case like some kind of a Peyton Place novel. <!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 5254-->
<!--Post: 5267--><!--Time: 1107011949-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST5267"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Stealth<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Stealth<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Saturday, January 29, 2005 - 7:19 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I think you summed it up pretty well Johno...<!--/Text--></td></tr>
